Third-party components

The MIT license above covers this project's own work. The following parts of
the repository are not covered by it and keep their own terms:

1. Vendored components, each with its own license file:
   - site/themes/hextra/            Hextra theme, MIT (site/themes/hextra/LICENSE)
   - site/assets/lib/flexsearch/    FlexSearch, Apache-2.0
                                    (site/assets/lib/flexsearch/LICENSE)
   - site/static/fonts/             iA Writer Duo and 0xProto, SIL Open Font
                                    License 1.1 (a LICENSE file in each font's
                                    directory)
   - sofleii/proto/studio/          ZMK Studio protobuf messages, from
                                    cormoran/zmk-studio-messages @ 89b81d2e,
                                    MIT, (c) 2024 The ZMK Contributors
                                    (sofleii/proto/studio/LICENSE)
   - sofleii/proto/ble_management/  ble_management.proto, from
                                    cormoran/zmk-module-ble-management
                                    @ 57738cc4, MIT, (c) 2026 cormoran
                                    (sofleii/proto/ble_management/LICENSE)

2. Files with their own SPDX-License-Identifier header keep the license and
   copyright stated in that header. For example, the shield files under
   config/boards/shields/eyelash_sofle/ are MIT, (c) The ZMK Contributors and
   (c) Darryl deHaan.

3. config/boards/shields/eyelash_sofle/eyelash_sofle-layouts.dtsi (and
   config/eyelash_sofle.json, generated from it) adapts the key geometry of
   ZMK's Sofle physical layout (app/dts/layouts/josefadamcik/sofle.dtsi),
   Copyright (c) 2020 The ZMK Contributors, under the MIT license, whose
   terms are the same as the license above.

4. This repository was forked from the Eyelash Sofle vendor's repository
   (a741725193/zmk-sofle), which has no license. The shield files that came
   from it carry their own MIT headers (item 2); every file without one has
   since been replaced or removed. Earlier commits in this repository's
   history still contain those files (the original physical layout files,
   the 3D case model, the original README, renders of other boards); they
   remain (c) their original authors, all rights reserved, and are NOT
   covered by the MIT license above.

5. keymap_drawer.config.yaml: started by Chen Zeng, edited by Pedro Satin,
   and borrowing technique from englmaxi's keymap-drawer config
   (github.com/englmaxi/zmk-config). (c) its original authors; not covered by
   the MIT license above.
